[[2047,127,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Follow security regulations prescribed\n(see 5040A - Warnings).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[2047,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the car on the lift.</p><p>Drain the coolant.\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a></p><p>1. Lift the car and unscrew the pipe union nut.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Plug the disconnected units properly,\nto prevent humidity and impurities from entering the system.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>2. Open the clamps fastening the pipe.</p><p>3. Unscrew the dehydrating support.</p><p>4. Release the dehydrating and the support from the body.</p><p>5. Disconnect the electrical connection of the multilevel pressure\nswitch.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>4 stage pressure switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236459\">K10</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>6. Unscrew the pipe.</p><p>7. Remove the pipe.</p><p>8. Unscrew and remove the multilevel pressure switch from the pipe.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018463.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the pipe is not damaged or splitted.</p><p>Screw the multipressure switch on the\npipe.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Multistage pressure switch</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.7 - 1.1</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Reposition the pipe.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Replace the O-rings of the unions.</p><p>Use\ngreen coolantproof rings R134A.</p><p>Lubricate the union thread\nwith antifreezing oil.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Connect the union to the dehydrating and\nscrew it.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>Drier filter pipe connector</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9 - 1.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the multilevel pressure switch\nelectrical connection.</p><p>Fasten the dehydrating with its support\nto the body.</p><p>Fasten the pipe with the clamps.</p><p>Connect the intermediate union and tighten\nit with the nut.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>Intermediate connector</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9 - 1.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Reload the coolant.\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a></p><p>Remove the car from the lift.</p>"]]